 lifecycle: design, development, testing, and operating in production\\n5. Build solutions with a high level of reliability, scalability, and security\\n\\n## Minimum Requirement:\\n1. Graduated less than 12 months ago or about to complete a Bachelor's or Master's Degree in Computer Science, Computer Engineering, or related fields at time of application\\n2. Programming experience in one or more programming languages (e.g., Python, C, C++, Java)\\n3. Knowledge of Computer Science fundamentals such as object-oriented design, algorithm design, data structures, problem solving and complexity analysis\\n4. Experience working with data structures or algorithms during coursework/projects, research, internships, or practical experience in school or work (e.g., open-source coding).\", command='curl -s \"http://the-agent-company.com:8092/index.php/s/MCf7Sz8Hd5bo8MD/download\" | head -20', observation=<ObservationType.RUN: 'run'>, metadata=CmdOutputMetadata(exit_code=0, pid=-1, username='root', hostname='ecs-d984', working_dir='/outputs', py_interpreter_path='/openhands/poetry/openhands-ai-5O4_aCHf-py3.12/bin/python', prefix='', suffix='\\n[The command completed with exit code 0.]'), hidden=False), CmdRunAction(command='\\n\\ncat /workspace/link.txt\\n\\n', is_input=False, thought='Excellent! The file is successfully uploaded and accessible via the share link. Let me also verify that the link.txt file contains the correct URL:', blocking=False, is_static=False, cwd=None, hidden=False, action=<ActionType.RUN: 'run'>, confirmation_state='confirmed', security_risk=None), CmdOutputObservation(content='http://the-agent-company.com:8092/index.php/s/MCf7Sz8Hd5bo8MD', command='cat /workspace/link.txt', observation=<ObservationType.RUN: 'run'>, metadata=CmdOutputMetadata(exit_code=0, pid=-1, username='root', hostname='ecs-d984', working_dir='/outputs', py_interpreter_path='/openhands/poetry/openhands-ai-5O4_aCHf-py3.12/bin/python', prefix='', suffix='\\n[The command completed with exit code 0.]'), hidden=False), MCPAction(name='update_operation_guide', arguments={'platform': 'ownCloud', 'operation': 'CreateJobDescriptionAndShareLink', 'details': '# OwnCloud - Create Job Description and Share Link\\n\\n## Steps:\\n1. Navigate to OwnCloud at http://the-agent-company.com:8092\\n2. Create a job description by merging template.md and requirement.txt files\\n3. Upload the job_description.md file to the Documents directory using curl:\\n   - `curl -u \"theagentcompany:theagentcompany\" -T \"/workspace/job_description.md\" \"http://the-agent-company.com:8092/remote.php/webdav/Documents/job_description.md\"`\\n4. Create a share link using the API:\\n   - `curl -u \"theagentcompany:theagentcompany\" -X POST \"http://the-agent-company.com:8092/ocs/v2.php/apps/files_sharing/api/v1/shares\" -d \"path=/Documents/job_description.md\" -d \"shareType=3\" -d \"permissions=1\"`\\n5. Extract the share URL from the API response (look for the <url> tag in the XML response)\\n6. Save the share URL to link.txt file in the workspace\\n\\n## Verification Steps:\\n- Verify file upload by downloading via share link: `curl -s \"http://the-agent-company.com:8092/index.php/s/{token}/download\" | head -20`\\n- Confirm link.txt contains the correct share URL\\n\\n## Notes:\\n- The file may not immediately appear in the browser interface but can be verified via download\\n- Share type 3 creates a public link accessible to anyone\\n- Permissions=1 provides read-only access\\n- The share URL format is: http://the-agent-company.com:8092/index.php/s/{token}\\n- The direct download URL is: http://the-agent-company.com:8092/index.php/s/{token}/download\\n- The API returns XML format, extract the URL from the <url> tag\\n- Always verify both upload and share link creation were successful'}, thought='Perfect! The task has been completed successfully. Let me now update the SOP guide with any additional insights from this execution.', action=<ActionType.MCP: 'call_tool_mcp'>, security_ris